<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Christ appeared to usher in</l><l>The glorious age of Jubilee!</l><l>He brought God to men,</l><l>And from the hold of Satan set them free!</l><l>Eyes He opened, hearts He mended,</l><l>Burdened sinners He released!</l><l>‘Tis the season of salvation</l><l>Purposed from eternity!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Rise up, Christians, go and open</l><l>People’s eyes that they may see!</l><l>Turn them unto God from darkness,</l><l>From His foe’s authority!</l><l>Sins’ forgiveness</l><l>And a portion of the saints they will receive!</l><l>Sanctified by faith to taste</l><l>The blessing of God’s Jubilee!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
